        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okobwatana okw’Omonene akorete n’Abaisraeli ase ense ya Moabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya n’aro amang’ana y’okobwatana kw’ogotianania Omonene achiigete Musa akore n’Abaisraeli agwo ase ense ya Moabu. Okobwatana okwo nigo kwamentetwe ase kori’Omonene konya akorire amo nabarabwo aaria Horebu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa agasangereria Abaisraeli bonsi amo, akabateebia, “’Mwarooche n’amaiso aino amang’an’Omonene akorete ase ense ya Misiri, na buna akorerete Farao amo n’abanene b’ense yaye, na ense yaye yonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo ’mwarooche n’amaiso aino amaakwa aria amanene, na ebikone, n’amakumia amanene;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "korende goika rituko ria rero Omonene taraigora ebirengererio biaino, erinde monyaare komanya buya; gose tarabaa amaiso akorora buya, gose amato akoigwa buya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki yonsi y’emiaka emerongo ene Omonene abeete okobaraa ase erooro. Chianga chiaino tichiabagoterete, gose ebikoroto biaino tibiabagoterete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timwabeete mokoria omogati, gose konywa edivai, gose ekenyugwa kende gionsi kegotindia, erio nario moranyaare komanya ng’a ere nere Omonene Nyasae oino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero twachete aase aya, Sihoni omorwoti o Hesiboni, na Ogi, omorwoti o Basani, bagaacha gotorwania esegi, korende tokababua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tokaira ense yabo, tokayea abanto b’egesaku kia Rubeni, na ab’ekia Gadi, na ekeng’ese ki’egesaku kia Manase, na eyio ekaba omwando obo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio moigwere, mokore amang’ana onsi ay’okobwatana okwo kw’ogotianania erio nario morasesenigwe ase emeremo yonsi moraabe mogokora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Rituko ria reero inwe mwensi nigo moteneine aiga ase obosio bw’Omonene Nyasae oino; inwe abatang’ani b’ebisaku, na abagaaka, na abateneneri, inwe kera oyomo bw’Abaisraeli,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na abana baino, n’abakuungu baino, na abamenyi abwo bamenyete amo nainwe ase ebitwori biaino, na abanto bonsi abwo bakobaateria chiinko amo n’abwo bakobarentera amaache.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na boono ’monyaare gosoa ase okobwatana kw’ogotianania okw’Omonene Nyasae oino, agokora amo nainwe rituko ria reero,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "erinde ase rituko ria reero, Omonene anyare kobakora mobe abanto baye b’ekeene. Ere ’nabe Nyasae oino, buna abateebetie na buna arierete chisokoro chiaino Aburaamu, na Isaka, na Yakobo, eira ase ogotiana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gose tari nainwe mweka ’ngokora okobwatana okwo kw’ogotianania,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "korende nigo ’nkogokora nainwe abamoteneine aiga reero amo naintwe ase obosio bw’Omonene Nyasae oito, naende amo nabwo batateneini amo naintwe aiga reero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inwe abanyene ’momanyete buna obogima bwaito bwarenge ekero twamenyete ase ense ya Misiri, naende buna twarweteo na goeta egati‐gati y’ebisaku ebio ase twaetete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "’Mwarooche ebinto babwate bi’okogeechia, emegwekano yabo baare gosasiima, yaroisirie korwa ase emete, n’amagena, ne’chifeta, ne’chitaabu, eyio yarenge ase egati yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwerende, tabaisa koba ase egati yaino omonto omosacha gose omokungu, gose eamate, gose egesaku, oraonchoke ase rituko ria reero, atige Omonene Nyasae oito, na gosasiima chinyasae chi’ abanto b’ebisaku ebio. Toba ase egati yaino omori okomera ekemeri kere n’obosongo gekwama okwama okororo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto aise koba aiga, oyo oigwete amang’ana y’okobwatana okwo kw’ogotianania naende eremie abe n’obomaene ime ase enkoro yaye, erio akwane: Nabo er’abe buya ase ’nde nonya ’nkogenderera koba oyotaigwereti, oyio nigo arabasirie mwensi, abamogotinda na abamore nerang’o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene takonyaara kwabera omonto onga buna oyio, korende endamwamu yaye, ne’risemi ’mbibe igoro y’omonto oyio, na okoragereria okwo gwonsi koriikire ase egetabu eke nigo koraabeere ase are, n’Omonene natinyie erieta ri’omonto oyio rirue inse y’erioba, tainyorwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene ’namokore abe ekiorokererio ase amasio y’ abanto b’ebisaku bionsi bi’Abaisraeli, na amorentere amaakwa onsi koreng’ana n’okoragereria gw’okobwatana kw’ogotianania oko koriikire ase egetabu eke y’amachiiko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase ebiaare bigochi‐goocha, ne’chinderia chiaino, n’abamenyi baraache korwa ase chinse chi’aare, ’mbarore emechando y’ense eria, na amarwaire Omonene ayetomeire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ense yonsi inayome pa ebe buna amagena y’omorero akonyititoka, na omonyoo, ebe bosa etari kwama, noonya n’obonyansi tibokomerao, esirigwe buna emechie ya Sodomu, na Gomora, na Adima, na Seboimu, eri’Omonene asiretie ekero abeete n’endamwamu na okogeechigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, ebisaku bionsi ’mbiboorie: Ninki kiagerete Omonene akorete ense eye ekaba iga? ’Naki endamwamu yaye yokire iga?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanto mbairanerie, bateebe: Ayio nigo akoregete, ekiagera abanto baatigete okobwatana kw’ogotianania kw’Omonene, Nyasae bw’echisokoro chiabo, okwo akorete amo nabarabwo, ekero abarusetie korwa ase ense ya Misiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo nigo barenge gokorera chinyasae ching’ao na gochisasiima, chinyasae barabwo batamanyete agwo ritang’ani, echi’Omonene atabaete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio endamwamu y’Omonene ekaba enene ase ense eye, ere akarenta okoragereria gwonsi okwo koriikire ase egetabu eke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase endamwamu yaye enene, na obotindi, ne’risemi rinene, Omonene akabaseeria korwa ase ense yabo, akabasiarera gochia ase ense eng’ao; nao bare goika reero iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Amang’ana abobisi nigo are ase Omonene Nyasae oito, korende ayio amaanoirwe nigo are ase tore na ase abana baito kogenderera botambe, naintwe goika tokore amang’ana onsi ariikire ase amachiiko aya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
